\li1 \v 15 \rb On the south|נֶ֕גְבָּה\rb* \rb side|וּפְאַת־\rb* \rb the border|הַגְּבוּל֙\rb* \rb began at the outskirts|מִקְצֵ֖ה\rb*\rb |קִרְיַ֣ת\rb* \rb of Kiriath-jearim|יְעָרִ֑ים\rb* \rb and extended|וְיָצָ֤א\rb* \rb westward|יָ֔מָּה\rb*\rb |וְיָצָ֕א\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the spring|מַעְיַ֖ן\rb* \rb at the Waters|מֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Nephtoah|נֶפְתּֽוֹחַ׃\rb*. \v 16 \rb Then it|הַגְּב֜וּל\rb* \rb went down|וְיָרַ֨ד\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the foot|קְצֵ֣ה\rb* \rb of the hill|הָהָ֗ר\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁר֙\rb* \rb faces|עַל־\rb*\rb |פְּנֵי֙\rb* \rb the Valley of Ben-hinnom|גֵּ֣י\rb*\rb |בֶן־\rb*\rb |הִנֹּ֔ם\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb at the northern|צָפ֑וֹנָה\rb* \rb end of the Valley|בְּעֵ֥מֶק\rb* \rb of Rephaim|רְפָאִ֖ים\rb* \rb and ran down|וְיָרַד֩\rb* \rb the Valley of Hinnom|גֵּ֨י\rb*\rb |הִנֹּ֜ם\rb* \rb toward|אֶל־\rb* \rb the southern|נֶ֔גְבָּה\rb* \rb slope|כֶּ֤תֶף\rb* \rb of the Jebusites|הַיְבוּסִי֙\rb* \rb and downward|וְיָרַ֖ד\rb*\rb |עֵ֥ין\rb* \rb to En-rogel|רֹגֵֽל׃\rb*. \v 17 \rb From there it curved|וְתָאַ֣ר\rb* \rb northward|מִצָּפ֗וֹן\rb* \rb and proceeded|וְיָצָא֙\rb*\rb |עֵ֣ין\rb* \rb to En-shemesh|שֶׁ֔מֶשׁ\rb*\rb |וְיָצָא֙\rb* \rb and on to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Geliloth|גְּלִיל֔וֹת\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb facing|נֹ֖כַח\rb* \rb the Ascent|מַעֲלֵ֣ה\rb* \rb of Adummim|אֲדֻמִּ֑ים\rb*, \rb and continued down|וְיָרַ֕ד\rb* \rb to the Stone|אֶ֥בֶן\rb* \rb of Bohan|בֹּ֖הַן\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Reuben|רְאוּבֵֽן׃\rb*. \v 18 \rb Then it went on|וְעָבַ֛ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the northern|צָפ֑וֹנָה\rb* \rb slope|כֶּ֥תֶף\rb* \rb of|מוּל־\rb* \rb Beth-arabah|הָֽעֲרָבָ֖ה\rb*\f + \fr 18:18 \ft LXX; Hebrew \fqa slope facing the Arabah\f* \rb and went down|וְיָרַ֖ד\rb* \rb into the valley|הָעֲרָבָֽתָה׃\rb*. \v 19 \rb The border|הַגְּב֜וּל\rb* \rb continued|וְעָבַ֨ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the northern|צָפוֹנָה֒\rb* \rb slope|כֶּ֣תֶף\rb*\rb |בֵּית־\rb* \rb of Beth-hoglah|חָגְלָה֮\rb* \rb and came out|וְהָיָה\rb*\rb |תֹּצְאוֹתָיו\rb* \rb at|אֶל־\rb* \rb the northern|צָפ