\p \v 14 \rb Now behold|וְהִנֵּ֨ה\rb*, \rb today|הַיּ֔וֹם\rb* \rb I|אָנֹכִ֤י\rb* \rb am going|הוֹלֵךְ֙\rb* \rb the way|בְּדֶ֖רֶךְ\rb* \rb of all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the earth|הָאָ֑רֶץ\rb*, \rb and you know|וִידַעְתֶּ֞ם\rb* \rb with all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb your heart|לְבַבְכֶ֣ם\rb* \rb and|וּבְכָל־\rb* \rb soul|נַפְשְׁכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb that|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb one|אֶחָ֜ד\rb* \rb of the good|הַטּוֹבִ֗ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb promises|הַדְּבָרִ֣ים\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֤ה\rb* \rb your God|אֱלֹהֵיכֶם֙\rb* \rb made|דִּבֶּ֜ר\rb* \rb to you|עֲלֵיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb has failed|נָפַל֩\rb*. \rb Everything|הַכֹּל֙\rb* \rb was fulfilled|בָּ֣אוּ\rb* \rb for you|לָכֶ֔ם\rb*; \rb not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb one|אֶחָֽד׃\rb* \rb promise|דָּבָ֥ר\rb* \rb has failed|נָפַ֥ל\rb*. \v 15 \rb |וְהָיָ֗ה\rb* \rb But just as|כַּאֲשֶׁר־\rb*\rb |עֲלֵיכֶם֙\rb* \rb every|כָּל־\rb* \rb good|הַטּ֔וֹב\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb thing|הַדָּבָ֣ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb your God|אֱלֹהֵיכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb promised|דִּבֶּ֛ר\rb* \rb you|אֲלֵיכֶ֑ם\rb* \rb has come to pass|בָּ֤א\rb*, \rb likewise|כֵּן֩\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֜ה\rb* \rb will bring|יָבִ֨יא\rb* \rb upon you|עֲלֵיכֶ֗ם\rb*\rb |אֵ֚ת\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb the calamity He has threatened|הָרָ֔ע\rb*, \rb until|עַד־\rb* \rb He has destroyed|הַשְׁמִיד֣וֹ\rb* \rb you|אוֹתְכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb from|מֵ֠עַל\rb* \rb this|הַזֹּ֔את\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר֙\rb* \rb good|הַטּוֹבָה֙\rb* \rb land|הָאֲדָמָ֤ה\rb* \rb He|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֱלֹהֵיכֶֽם׃\rb* \rb has given|נָתַ֣ן\rb* \rb you|לָכֶ֔ם\rb*. \v 16 \rb If you transgress|בְּ֠עָבְרְכֶם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the covenant|בְּרִ֨ית\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb your God|אֱלֹהֵיכֶם֮\rb*, \rb which|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb He commanded you|צִוָּ֣ה\rb*,\rb |אֶתְכֶם֒\rb* \rb and go|וַהֲלַכְתֶּ֗ם\rb* \rb and serve|וַעֲבַדְתֶּם֙\rb* \rb other|אֲחֵרִ֔ים\rb* \rb gods|אֱלֹהִ֣ים\rb* \rb and bow down|וְהִשְׁתַּחֲוִיתֶ֖ם\rb* \rb to them|לָהֶ֑ם\rb*, \rb then the anger|אַף־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb will burn|וְחָרָ֤ה\rb* \rb against you|בָּכֶ֔ם\rb*, \rb and yo